  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_header.webp\" alt=\"Header\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_promo.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_description.webp\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>Vintage Animations</strong> 全面改進了砍伐、挖掘、採集和耕作等基本動作的動畫。此模組非常適合為遊戲增添<strong>沉浸感</strong>與<strong>角色扮演機制</strong>。這些動畫靈感來自於《Vintage Story》這款遊戲。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_compatibility.webp\" alt=\"Compatibility\"></p>\n<p>如果某個模組未標註為相容，它仍有可能運作。若無法使用，請回報問題，我會嘗試新增相容性支援。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Better Combat ✅</li>\n<li>First Person Model ✅</li>\n<li>Real Camera ✅</li>\n<li>Epic Fight ❌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_showcase.webp\" alt=\"Showcase\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fRaub0R2ezv0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/Raub0R2ezv0</a></p>",
